        <item>
            <title>0.14.76</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 13:09:42 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>137</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.76</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Recording on Bluetooth no longer pops the macOS Screen Recording prompt. The default audio-only recording needs only Microphone; the (silent) Bluetooth screen-capture backup is skipped unless Screen Recording is already granted, so a fresh user is not pushed into a permission that requires a restart.</li>
<li>On-device transcription no longer fails with a timeout during the first model compile on a slow Mac. It now waits for the background compile to finish and caches it (later transcripts load fast) instead of giving up and marking the meeting failed.</li>
<li>A &quot;Start a new recording&quot; button appears while the model is downloading, so you can keep recording without waiting for it to finish.</li>
<li>Profile menu: the green Sign in button moved to the bottom, below a separator under Get help and Check for updates, and its corners are squarer.</li>
<li>The Download button is disabled when there is nothing to export (a failed or empty meeting), instead of showing a live green button.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
